 this is PR #1648 if you are curious.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/348336208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/350831661","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1444#issuecomment-350831661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1444","id":350831661,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1MDgzMTY2MQ==","user":{"login":"tsuna","id":128281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODI4MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna","html_url":"https://github.com/tsuna","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsuna/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-12-11T19:30:21Z","updated_at":"2017-12-11T19:30:21Z","body":"Just to be clear (and for the casual pedestrian stumbling on this issue and seeing it closed) the issue isn't actually fixed unless we use the new `DialOption` called `WithWaitForHandshake()`, right?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/350831661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/350834648","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1444#issuecomment-350834648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/1444","id":350834648,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM1MDgzNDY0OA==","user":{"login":"dfawley","id":26072277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDcyMjc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26072277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley","html_url":"https://github.com/dfawley","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dfawley/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-12-11T19:40:26Z","updated_at":"2017-12-11T19:40:26Z","body":"If I understand your concerns correctly, then I believe it should be fixed for everyone.  We will not consider a connection \"successful\" (from a backoff perspective) if the server never sent the HTTP2 preface to the client.\r\n\r\nThe option is there to prevent RPCs from being assigned to the channel until after the handshake has been received.  This can be set if you want extra-stable behavior so RPCs don't fail due to a connection that fails in this way.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/comments/350834648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]